# BullMarket Core

Personal finance monitor: BİST, crypto, FX/gold. Next.js App Router + React Query + node-cache.

## Token Efficiency

- Diffs only; never rewrite whole files.
- No prose/explanations unless asked with `?`.
- Prefer existing `types/`, `lib/api/`, `components/dashboard/` — do not invent parallel layers.
- Skip README/docs edits unless explicitly requested.

## Architecture Boundaries

```
lib/api/*  → adapters only (yahoo, binance, tcmb)
app/api/*/route.ts → cache + normalize + JSON envelope
components/* → UI only; fetch via React Query hooks, never call adapters directly
```

## Response Shape

```ts
{ success: true, data: T, cached?: boolean } | { success: false, error: string }
```

## Caching

Use `appCache` from `@/lib/cache`. Key format: `{domain}:{resource}:{id?}`. Default TTL 15s (FX 60s).

## Stack Locks

- Icons: `lucide-react` only
- Charts: `recharts`
- Styles: Tailwind v4 + `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Client polling: `refetchInterval: 15_000`
